    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "TOAST：PostgreSQL 把大字段藏在哪里",
      "summary": "Radim Marek 讲清了 TOAST 的机制：堆元组必须放进 8KB 页，超过约 2032 字节就触发瘦身，先压缩 EXTENDED 列，再把值挪到伴生的 TOAST 表，每块约 2000 字节，压缩可选 pglz 或 lz4。实用结论有几条：SELECT * 会把宽列全部解 TOAST；pg_column_size() 只读指针很便宜，length() 却要完整解压；改一个 1MB 的 jsonb 会重写全部分块。",
      "url": "https://boringsql.com/posts/postgresql-toast/",
      "author": "Radim Marek",
      "source": "boringsql.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-24",
      "image": "https://boringsql.com/og-images/postgresql-toast-og.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "TOAST",
        "存储",
        "jsonb"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "ORM 的多态关联为什么会拖垮规划器",
      "summary": "Andrei Lepikhov 讨论 ORM 常见的多态关联：一列要指向多张互不相关的表，通常用类型加 id 的判别式外键，再用一串带类型条件的 LEFT JOIN 还原。问题出在规划器：连接链上的选择率误差会逐级相乘放大，当 join_collapse_limit 被突破、EXISTS 子查询没能放到合适位置时，基表行要走完整条 LEFT JOIN 链才被过滤。作者说这篇先界定问题，后续再给优化器改法。",
      "url": "https://danolivo.substack.com/p/on-polymorphic-associations-in-postgres",
      "author": "Andrei Lepikhov",
      "source": "danolivo.substack.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-24",
      "image": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pWz9!,w_1200,h_675,c_fill,f_jpg,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ac3bea1-ece2-40da-895c-e0dc7112df0a_1536x1024.jpeg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "规划器",
        "ORM",
        "连接"
      ],
      "position": 2
